# The ffmpeg every package bundles beside the program (docs/app.md §19): the release of
# https://github.com/nettaisen/ffmpeg-build named here, and each of its files a package takes by its SHA-256
# (as sha256sum writes them). packaging/build.sh and packaging/windows/package.ps1 download and check them; to
# bundle another release, name its tag and copy its files' sums from its .sha256 files.
